        },
        "security": [
          {
            "sentin8:secrets:secret:admin": []
          }
        ],
        "description": "delete versions older than the\ncurrent one past the retention window (default 7d; `SENTIN8_SECRETS_PRUNE_DAYS`).\nIdempotent; safe to call from Sentin8:Cron (proxy-back). The reveal-audit\ntable is NEVER pruned (security-relevant history).\nHandle maintenance prune."
      }
    },
